script = ExtResource("1")
name = "family_inferno_a3"
description = "The Inferno family built on purpose at the act III boss: expected_a3's level, armor and shrine, a Rare Lance (brutal, swift) with the family's runes (ember_rune, pyre_rune), and 10 perks leaning on the family (3+ pieces awake): ignite, kindling, blazing_roll, thorns, frenzy, precision, strength, vitality, phoenix_feather, war_banner. Compared with the other family builds and expected_a3 (pillar 3: builds, not piles; pillar 4: comparable families)."
